WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I had to learn a lot
of dialogue for this movie.

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I was gonna say.
-Yes. You can tell.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.906
-There was so much --
Yeah, there was so much under --

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There was, like,
text and subtext.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what I liked about it.
-Yeah.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.378 line:92%
-Now, we should point out,

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is an intense,
incredible fight scene.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.414 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's not the only one.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is pretty nonstop action
throughout the film.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.183 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had some doubts
in the beginning

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you were up
for this kind of fight film.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Is that true?

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I mean,
unless you're a fighter,

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:25.959 line:92%
it's a really difficult thing

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
to kind of step in
and make believable, right?

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:32.198 size:88% position:44%
And a lot of this film,
the story and the motion

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
is really told
through this physical action,

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we try to do
some crazy-ass [bleep]

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you --
you trained with Keanu Reeves.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Is this true?

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I -- Look, I say
a lot of weird [bleep]

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's
probably not true, either.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:47.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, gotcha.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:51.851
-We trained in the same --
We trained in the same facility.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:52.852 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:55.555 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And...I saw him.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:56.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, actually,
we're really good friends.

00:00:58.324 --> 00:00:59.292 line:92%
We made two movies together.

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've known him
for over 20 years.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.729 line:92%
He's one of the greatest guys,

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we did train
in the same facility.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, it was funny,
because you didn't think

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the way that you wouldn't
think of yourself

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:10.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
as sort of this
fighting action hero.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:12.872
Keanu Reeves, in just sort of
recent years as John Wick,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:15.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
has become
the same sort of incredible,

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, sort of physical actor.
-Yeah.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:18.445
-So it seems to be
a perfect person to train with.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:21.014
-Yeah, I mean, I feel like he's
done a couple of action films,

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:23.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
but he's great
in this character.

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:23.850 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.551 line:92%
-And he was definitely --

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:27.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was because he's
a really good friend of mine,

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.488 line:92%
it was good to have him there,

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:31.524 size:81% position:41%
because it's so hard
to train on this level

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.192 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
four or five hours.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you did, then,
get injured, right?

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.096 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Knee? Tooth?

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:36.729 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I was bruised.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't have
any massive injuries,

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:41.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
nothing that would make, like,
a really cool story.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.236 size:78% position:39%
-Were you bummed out?
-I was a little bit.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.039
Like, this story's been running
around the press that,

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
I cracked two teeth.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it just sounds like
somebody, like,

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:50.243 size:81% position:41% line:92%
busted me in the face.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, really,
I just did it myself,

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.179 size:88% position:44% line:92%
clenching on my own jaw.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.448 size:75% position:38%
-Oh, well, that's --
that's a lot worse.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:56.483 line:92%
-It's not as cool, you know?

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"And it was
back at my hotel room and..."

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:00.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
I wasn't even aware of it.

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:01.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I was watching
'Real Housewives,'

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I saw something
that just freaked me out.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were you there?
-I was there, yeah.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Jesus.
-Your kids --

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:08.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know your kids
were around the set.

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
Were they aware
that their mom was sort of

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:13.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
going out every day
to sort of get waled on?

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.536
-That would make me
a terrible mother, wouldn't it?

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughing ]

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:19.305 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I try not to --

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
I try to be responsible.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:23.977
But there were a few days where
I definitely forgot to not --

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:27.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, to let my mom know
not to bring them around.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, right.
To set and stuff?

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, and then
you'll have to --

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.218 line:92%
You know, got to think fast.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so,
there's been a few times,

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.590
you know, when I was like,
"Mommy, had a -- I was painting.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had a paint party."
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:43.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"And I got some paint
on my face and my clothes."

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:44.964 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
"A lot of, uh, red paint.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was painting a barn.
Mommy was painting a barn."

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.302 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:50.370 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Things like that, yeah.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This takes place in 1989,
in Berlin.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:56.009
-Five days before the Wall falls
in Berlin, yes.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:03:00.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And yet the villains are
sort of the Russians and KGB,

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.315 line:92%
so works out really well.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
Very great branding
for the film.

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:05.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sounds so far-fetched,
doesn't it?

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:06.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you had to learn
some Russian.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
How's your Russian?
-Terrible.

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:09.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it really bad?
-Yeah.

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How do you say "terrible"
in Russian?

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:13.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't have a clue.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.493 --> 00:03:14.360 line:92%
-[ Russian accent ] "Terrible."

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Normal voice]
I think that's it.

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.130 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, God. Oh, yeah.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.097 line:92%
-How much did you have to learn?

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:19.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or, how many lines
did you have in Russian?

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.835
-Well, we had -- we had very
specific scenes that I learned.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then, we got there,
and then we did a rewrite,

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:27.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I had to relearn
different lines,

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:27.774 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and it was just --

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:30.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's a really
difficult language to learn

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:33.146
without drinking tons of vodka.
-Yeah.

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:35.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which I couldn't do,
'cause I had to fight a lot,

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:37.717 line:92%
so I had to stay sober for --

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:41.287
-I bet there are some Russians
who drink vodka and then fight.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
I bet they don't let that
get in the way.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
A couple.
There's one or two, I'm sure.

